# Shell scripts and container definitions use LF on every development platform.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
**/Dockerfile* text eol=lf

# Binary assets must not undergo line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.zip binary
*.so binary

# 第三方规则和通知默认折叠展示，来源目录与应用适配仍按正常代码审阅。
